    board: file AUG-169 (symlinked directory escapes silently) and record AUG-148's two instrument reds
    
    AUG-148 is NOT closed. Two judge runs today, both red for instrument reasons, both
    published as evidence:
    
    - run 52162def at 6692f62: tier1 red on 2 board-evidence audit tests because commit
      6692f62 closed three QA rows with no evidence_run_id. Repaired in 58f5af4.
    - run 4bd93bbe at 58f5af4: tier1 PASS (bash tests/gate.sh green, GATE PASS), tier2
