    a symlinked DIRECTORY resolving outside the corpus root is neither refused nor
    counted — validate answered "1 document(s) ok" rc 0 over a corpus holding
    sub -> outside/secret.xml. Filed as AUG-169 (P3) with four command-shaped criteria
    and the sentinel no-leak pin.
    
