    committed with `git -c core.hooksPath=/dev/null`. The gate has not re-run on this exact
    tree; the transcript above it is `bash tests/gate.sh` green on the same tree minus these
    bookkeeping lines (verdict 4bd93bbe, tier1 PASS).
    
